// A typographic quote stays off the suggestion.
// Ordinary program: no HOLD_FLASH line.

CUBE quote ROLE observer PROTON 1
CUBE law   ROLE nanobot  PROTON 1

PLUG quote law

IMPULSE quote 1
IMPULSE law 1
ENERGYFLOW 1
FLOW 1
HARMONY law
DECIDE law
ASSERT CUBES >= 2
PRINT "quote" UNITY DECIDE ENERGY
